      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设}B\\text{“仪器不合格”，}A_{i}\\text{“仪器上有}i\\text{个部件不是优质品},i=0,1,2,3,\\text{显然}A_{0},A_{1},A_{2},A_{3}\\text{构成一个完备事件组，且}\\\\ P(B|A_{0})=0,P(B|A_{1})=0.2,P(B|A_{2})=0.6,P(B|A_{3})=0.9,\\\\ P(A_{0})=0.8\\times 0.7\\times 0.9=0.504,\\\\ P(A_{1})=0.2\\times 0.7\\times 0.9+0.8\\times 0.3\\times 0.9+0.8\\times 0.7\\times 0.1=0.398,\\\\ P(A_{3})=0.2\\times 0.3\\times 0.1=0.006,\\\\ P(A_{2})=1-P(A_{0})-P(A_{1})-P(A_{3})=0.092.\\\\ (\\text{1})\\text{应用全概率公式}，\\text{有}\\\\ P(B)=\\sum_{i=0}^{3}P(A_{i})P(B|A_{i})\\\\ =0.504\\times 0+0.398\\times 0.2+0.092\\times 0.6+0.006\\times 0.9=0.1402.\\\\ (\\text{2})\\text{应用贝叶斯公式}，\\text{有}\\\\ P(A_{0}|B)=0,P(A_{1}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{1})P(B|A_{1})}{P(B)}=\\frac{796}{1402},\\\\ P(A_{2}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{2})P(B|A_{2})}{P(B)}=\\frac{552}{1402},\\\\ P(A_{3}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{3})P(B|A_{3})}{P(B)}=\\frac{54}{1402}.\\\\ \\text{从计算结果可知，一台不合格的仪器中有一个部件不是优质品的概率最大。}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设}B\\text{“仪器不合格”，}A_{i}\\text{“仪器上有}i\\text{个部件不是优质品},i=0,1,2,3,\\text{显然}A_{0},A_{1},A_{2},A_{3}\\text{构成一个完备事件组，且}\\\\ P(B|A_{0})=0,P(B|A_{1})=0.2,P(B|A_{2})=0.6,P(B|A_{3})=0.9,\\\\ P(A_{0})=0.8\\times 0.7\\times 0.9=0.504,\\\\ P(A_{1})=0.2\\times 0.7\\times 0.9+0.8\\times 0.3\\times 0.9+0.8\\times 0.7\\times 0.1=0.398,\\\\ P(A_{3})=0.2\\times 0.3\\times 0.1=0.006,\\\\ P(A_{2})=1-P(A_{0})-P(A_{1})-P(A_{3})=0.092.\\\\ (\\text{1})\\text{应用全概率公式}，\\text{有}\\\\ P(B)=\\sum_{i=0}^{3}P(A_{i})P(B|A_{i})\\\\ =0.504\\times 0+0.398\\times 0.2+0.092\\times 0.6+0.006\\times 0.9=0.1402.\\\\ (\\text{2})\\text{应用贝叶斯公式}，\\text{有}\\\\ P(A_{0}|B)=0,P(A_{1}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{1})P(B|A_{1})}{P(B)}=\\frac{796}{1402},\\\\ P(A_{2}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{2})P(B|A_{2})}{P(B)}=\\frac{552}{1402},\\\\ P(A_{3}|B)=\\frac{P(A_{3})P(B|A_{3})}{P(B)}=\\frac{54}{1402}.\\\\ \\text{从计算结果可知，一台不合格的仪器中有一个部件不是优质品的概率最大。}\\end{aligned}</div>"
