      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由题意知:}P(B)=\\frac{60}{100}=\\frac{3}{5},\\quad P(\\overline{B})=\\frac{40}{100}=\\frac{2}{5},\\quad P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{5}{6},\\quad\\quad P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{80-50}{40}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\\\&amp;\\text{则由全概率公式得:}\\ P(A)=P(B)P(AB)+P(\\overline{B})P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{4}{5}=0.8;\\\\&amp;\\text{由乘法公式得:}\\ P(AB)=P(B)P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{1}{2}=0.5;\\\\&amp;\\text{由贝叶斯公式得,}\\ P(B|A)=\\frac{P(AB)}{P(A)}=\\frac{0.5}{0.8}=\\frac{5}{8}=0.625.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由题意知:}P(B)=\\frac{60}{100}=\\frac{3}{5},\\quad P(\\overline{B})=\\frac{40}{100}=\\frac{2}{5},\\quad P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{5}{6},\\quad\\quad P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{80-50}{40}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\\\&amp;\\text{则由全概率公式得:}\\ P(A)=P(B)P(AB)+P(\\overline{B})P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{4}{5}=0.8;\\\\&amp;\\text{由乘法公式得:}\\ P(AB)=P(B)P(A|\\overline{B})=\\frac{1}{2}=0.5;\\\\&amp;\\text{由贝叶斯公式得,}\\ P(B|A)=\\frac{P(AB)}{P(A)}=\\frac{0.5}{0.8}=\\frac{5}{8}=0.625.\\end{aligned}</div>"
